[2026-05-28 21:35:12] [INFO] [UNKNOWN] Input: {"session_id":"3dd6fad1-88ba-4db1-be5e-93fb624bab94","transcript_path":"C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.claude\\projects\\D--CodeDevelopment-CodeProject-claude-hk\\3dd6fad1-88ba-4db1-be5e-93fb624bab94.jsonl","cwd":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk","permission_mode":"auto","effort":{"level":"medium"},"hook_event_name":"PostToolBatch","tool_calls":[{"tool_name":"Read","tool_input":{"file_path":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-05-28\\claude-tap-plus-database-schema.md"},"tool_use_id":"call_7b6b97db3ab349b89080b859","tool_response":"1\t# claude-tap-plus 数据库表结构汇总\n2\t\n3\t> 创建时间：2026-05-28\n4\t> 来源：汇总 `doc/otherDoc/2026-05-26` 和 `2026-05-27` 所有设计文档中的表结构定义\n5\t> 数据库：SQLite（单机部署，零配置）\n6\t\n7\t---\n8\t\n9\t## 总览\n10\t\n11\t共 4 张表，分为两大业务域：\n12\t\n13\t| 业务域 | 表名 | 说明 | 归属包 |\n14\t|--------|------|------|--------|\n15\t| 会话管理 | `machines` | 机器信息 | `internal/backend/store/session_store.go` |\n16\t| 会话管理 | `projects` | 项目信息 | `internal/backend/store/session_store.go` |\n17\t| 会话管理 | `sessions` | 会话注册记录 | `internal/backend/store/session_store.go` |\n18\t| Issue 管理 | `issue_claims` | Issue 领取与状态追踪 | `internal/backend/store/issue_store.go` |\n19\t\n20\t---\n21\t\n22\t## ER 关系图\n23\t\n24\t```\n25\t┌─────────────┐       ┌─────────────┐       ┌─────────────┐\n26\t│  machines   │       │  sessions   │       │  projects   │\n27\t├─────────────┤       ├─────────────┤       ├─────────────┤\n28\t│ machine_id  │◄──────│ machine_id  │       │ project_slug│◄──┐\n29\t│ (PK)        │  1:N  │ project_slug│──────►│ (PK)        │   │\n30\t│             │       │ session_id  │  N:1  │             │   │\n31\t│             │       │ (UQ)        │       │             │   │\n32\t└─────────────┘       │ trace_path  │       └─────────────┘   │\n33\t                      │ status      │                         │\n34\t                      └──────┬──────┘                         │\n35\t                             │                                │\n36\t                             │ session_id                     │\n37\t                             ▼                                │\n38\t                      ┌──────────────┐                        │\n39\t                      │issue_claims  │                        │\n40\t                      ├──────────────┤                        │\n41\t                      │ session_id   │────────────────────────┘\n42\t                      │ repo_full_name│   (通过 project_slug 关联)\n43\t                      │ issue_number │\n44\t                      │ status       │\n45\t                      └──────────────┘\n46\t```\n47\t\n48\t---\n49\t\n50\t## 1. machines 表\n51\t\n52\t**用途**：记录使用 claude-tap-plus 的机器信息，`machine_id` 格式为 `whoami@hostname`。\n53\t\n54\t```sql\n55\tCREATE TABLE machines (\n56\t    id              INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT,\n57\t    machine_id      TEXT NOT NULL UNIQUE,           -- whoami@hostname\n58\t    os              TEXT NOT NULL,                  -- windows/linux/macos\n59\t    hostname        TEXT NOT NULL,                  -- hostname 命令\n60\t    username        TEXT NOT NULL,                  -- whoami 命令\n61\t    first_seen_at   DATETIME NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,\n62\t    last_seen_at    DATETIME                        -- 每次 SessionStart 更新\n63\t);\n64\t\n65\tCREATE INDEX idx_machines_hostname ON machines(hostname);\n66\t```\n67\t\n68\t### 字段来源\n69\t\n70\t| 字段 | 来源 | 获取方式 |\n71\t|------|------|----------|\n72\t| machine_id | 系统命令 | `whoami` + `@` + `hostname` |\n73\t| os | platform.sh | `uname -s` 解析为 OS_TYPE |\n74\t| hostname | 从 machine_id 解析 | 按 `@` 分割取后半部分 |\n75\t| username | 从 machine_id 解析 | 按 `@` 分割取前半部分 |\n76\t\n77\t### 写入时机\n78\t\n79\t| 时机 | 操作 |\n80\t|------|------|\n81\t| SessionStart (POST /api/session/register) | INSERT OR IGNORE + UPDATE last_seen_at |\n82\t\n83\t---\n84\t\n85\t## 2. projects 表\n86\t\n87\t**用途**：记录 Claude Code 工作过的项目，`project_slug` 从 transcript_path 解析得到。\n88\t\n89\t```sql\n90\tCREATE TABLE projects (\n91\t    id              INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT,\n92\t    project_slug    TEXT NOT NULL UNIQUE,           -- 从 transcript_path 解析\n93\t    project_cwd     TEXT NOT NULL,                  -- 首次出现的 cwd\n94\t    first_seen_at   DATETIME NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,\n95\t    last_seen_at    DATETIME                        -- 每次该项目有新会话时更新\n96\t);\n97\t\n98\tCREATE INDEX idx_projects_slug ON projects(project_slug);\n99\t```\n100\t\n101\t### 字段来源\n102\t\n103\t| 字段 | 来源 | 获取方式 |\n104\t|------|------|----------|\n105\t| project_slug | transcript_path | `sed` 从路径中提取（如 `D--CodeDevelopment-CodeProject-claude-hk`） |\n106\t| project_cwd | SessionStart | `json_get '.cwd'` |\n107\t\n108\t### 写入时机\n109\t\n110\t| 时机 | 操作 |\n111\t|------|------|\n112\t| SessionStart (POST /api/session/register) | INSERT OR IGNORE + UPDATE last_seen_at |\n113\t\n114\t---\n115\t\n116\t## 3. sessions 表\n117\t\n118\t**用途**：记录每次 Claude Code 会话的元数据。后端只存元数据，消息内容存储在本地 JSONL trace 文件中。\n119\t\n120\t```sql\n121\tCREATE TABLE sessions (\n122\t    id              INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT,\n123\t    session_id      TEXT NOT NULL UNIQUE,           -- UUID，SessionStart 传入\n124\t    machine_id      TEXT NOT NULL,                  -- whoami@hostname\n125\t    os              TEXT NOT NULL,                  -- windows/linux/macos\n126\t    project_slug    TEXT NOT NULL,                  -- 从 transcript_path 解析\n127\t    project_cwd     TEXT NOT NULL,                  -- SessionStart 的 cwd 字段\n128\t    trace_path      TEXT NOT NULL,                  -- transcript_path（Claude Code 原始路径）\n129\t    model           TEXT,                           -- SessionStart 的 model 字段\n130\t    source          TEXT,                           -- startup/resume\n131\t    status          TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'active', -- active / closed\n132\t    registered_at   DATETIME NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,\n133\t    closed_at       DATETIME,                       -- SessionEnd 时更新\n134\t    close_reason    TEXT                            -- SessionEnd 的 reason 字段\n135\t);\n136\t\n137\tCREATE INDEX idx_sessions_machine ON sessions(machine_id);\n138\tCREATE INDEX idx_sessions_project ON sessions(project_slug);\n139\tCREATE INDEX idx_sessions_status ON sessions(status);\n140\tCREATE INDEX idx_sessions_registered ON sessions(registered_at);\n141\t```\n142\t\n143\t### 字段来源\n144\t\n145\t| 字段 | 来源 | 获取方式 |\n146\t|------|------|----------|\n147\t| session_id | SessionStart/End | `json_get '.session_id'` |\n148\t| machine_id | 系统命令 | `whoami` + `@` + `hostname` |\n149\t| os | platform.sh | `uname -s` 已解析为 OS_TYPE |\n150\t| project_slug | transcript_path | `sed` 从路径中提取 |\n151\t| project_cwd | SessionStart | `json_get '.cwd'` |\n152\t| trace_path | SessionStart | `json_get '.transcript_path'` |\n153\t| model | SessionStart | `json_get '.model'` |\n154\t| source | SessionStart | `json_get '.source'` |\n155\t| close_reason | SessionEnd | `json_get '.reason'` |\n156\t\n157\t### 状态枚举\n158\t\n159\t| 状态 | 说明 |\n160\t|------|------|\n161\t| `active` | 活跃会话 |\n162\t| `closed` | 已关闭 |\n163\t\n164\t### 写入时机\n165\t\n166\t| 时机 | 操作 |\n167\t|------|------|\n168\t| SessionStart (POST /api/session/register) | INSERT |\n169\t| SessionEnd (POST /api/session/close) | UPDATE status='closed', closed_at, close_reason |\n170\t\n171\t### 超时清理\n172\t\n173\t```sql\n174\t-- 将超过 24 小时仍为 active 的会话标记为 closed\n175\tUPDATE sessions\n176\tSET status = 'closed',\n177\t    closed_at = datetime('now'),\n178\t    close_reason = 'timeout_cleanup'\n179\tWHERE status = 'active'\n180\t  AND registered_at < datetime('now', '-24 hours');\n181\t```\n182\t\n183\t---\n184\t\n185\t## 4. issue_claims 表\n186\t\n187\t**用途**：存储 Issue 领取关系和状态流转。只存\"哪个 session 领取了哪个 issue\"及其状态，不存 issue 完整内容（内容在 GitHub 上）。\n188\t\n189\t```sql\n190\tCREATE TABLE issue_claims (\n191\t    id              INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT,\n192\t    repo_full_name  TEXT NOT NULL,                  -- xiaoheiDTF/claude-hk\n193\t    issue_number    INTEGER NOT NULL,               -- GitHub issue 编号\n194\t    issue_title     TEXT,                           -- issue 标题（缓存，方便展示）\n195\t    status          TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'idle',   -- 见状态枚举\n196\t    session_id      TEXT,                           -- 领取者的 session_id，idle 时为 null\n197\t    claimed_at      DATETIME,                       -- 领取时间\n198\t    updated_at      DATETIME NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,\n199\t\n200\t    UNIQUE(repo_full_name, issue_number)\n201\t);\n202\t\n203\tCREATE INDEX idx_issue_claims_repo ON issue_claims(repo_full_name);\n204\tCREATE INDEX idx_issue_claims_session ON issue_claims(session_id);\n205\tCREATE INDEX idx_issue_claims_status ON issue_claims(status);\n206\t```\n207\t\n208\t### 字段来源\n209\t\n210\t| 字段 | 来源 | 获取方式 |\n211\t|------|------|----------|\n212\t| repo_full_name | gh repo view | `gh repo view --json nameWithOwner --jq '.nameWithOwner'` |\n213\t| issue_number | gh issue list/view | `.number` |\n214\t| issue_title | gh issue view | `.title` |\n215\t| status | 后端维护 | 根据 API 调用更新 |\n216\t| session_id | 请求体传入 | API 调用方提供 |\n217\t| claimed_at | 后端生成 | 领取时 CURRENT_TIMESTAMP |\n218\t\n219\t### 状态枚举与流转\n220\t\n221\t```\n222\t            ┌─────────┐\n223\t ┌─────────►│  idle   │◄──────────────────┐\n224\t │          └────┬────┘                    │\n225\t │               │ claim                   │ release / session close\n226\t │               ▼                         │\n227\t │          ┌─────────┐                     │\n228\t │    ┌────►│ claimed │◄──┐                 │\n229\t │    │     └────┬────┘   │                 │\n230\t │    │          │ fix    │                 │\n231\t │    │          ▼        │                 │\n232\t │    │     ┌─────────┐◄──┤ reject          │\n233\t │    │     │ fixing  │   │ (from reviewing)│\n234\t │    │     └────┬────┘   │                 │\n235\t │    │          │ done   │                 │\n236\t │    │          ▼        │                 │\n237\t │    │    ┌─────────────┐│                 │\n238\t │    └────│ ready-for-pr││                 │\n239\t │         └──────┬──────┘│                 │\n240\t │                │ pr    │                 │\n241\t │                ▼       │                 │\n242\t │           ┌──────────┐ │                 │\n243\t │           │pr-created│ │                 │\n244\t │           └─────┬────┘ │                 │\n245\t │                 │ test │                 │\n246\t │                 ▼      │                 │\n247\t │            ┌─────────┐ │                 │\n248\t │            │ testing │ │                 │\n249\t │            └────┬────┘ │                 │\n250\t │                 │ review                  │\n251\t │                 ▼      │                 │\n252\t │           ┌───────────┐│                 │\n253\t │           │ reviewing ├┘                 │\n254\t │           └─────┬─────┘                  │\n255\t │                 │ merge                   │\n256\t │                 ▼                         │\n257\t │            ┌─────────┐                    │\n258\t │            │ merged  │────────────────────┘\n259\t │            └─────────┘\n260\t │\n261\t └─ 注：rejected 状态在 SessionEnd 时自动释放为 idle（可重新领取）\n262\t```\n263\t\n264\t| 状态 | 说明 | 对应 GitHub 操作 |\n265\t|------|------|-----------------|\n266\t| `idle` | 空闲，无人领取 | — |\n267\t| `claimed` | 已被某 session 领取 | gh issue edit --add-label \"in-progress\" |\n268\t| `fixing` | 正在开发中 | gh issue edit --add-label \"fixing\" |\n269\t| `ready-for-pr` | 开发完成，等待提 PR | gh issue edit --add-label \"ready-for-pr\" --remove-label \"in-progress\" |\n270\t| `pr-created` | PR 已创建 | gh issue edit --add-label \"pr-created\" |\n271\t| `testing` | 测试中 | gh issue edit --add-label \"testing\" |\n272\t| `reviewing` | 审核中 | gh issue edit --add-label \"reviewing\" |\n273\t| `merged` | 已合并（终态） | gh issue close |\n274\t| `rejected` | 被打回 | gh issue edit --add-label \"rejected\" |\n275\t\n276\t### 写入时机\n277\t\n278\t| 时机 | 操作 | 调用方 |\n279\t|------|------|--------|\n280\t| 首次 check/claim | INSERT OR IGNORE (idle) | 后端自动 |\n281\t| claim 成功 | UPDATE status='claimed', session_id=xxx | 003-4-issue-claim |\n282\t| 创建分支后 | UPDATE status='fixing' | 003-5-issue-fix |\n283\t| 开发完成后 | UPDATE status='ready-for-pr' | 003-6-issue-done |\n284\t| PR 创建后 | UPDATE status='pr-created' | 003-7-issue-pr |\n285\t| 开始测试时 | UPDATE status='testing' | 003-8-issue-test |\n286\t| 开始审核时 | UPDATE status='reviewing' | 003-9-issue-review |\n287\t| 合并后 | UPDATE status='merged' | 003-9-issue-review |\n288\t| 打回后 | UPDATE status='rejected' | 003-9-issue-review |\n289\t| 手动释放 | UPDATE status='idle', session_id=NULL | 异常放弃时 |\n290\t| SessionEnd | UPDATE status='idle', session_id=NULL（排除 merged） | SessionEnd hook |\n291\t\n292\t---\n293\t\n294\t## 完整建表脚本\n295\t\n296\t```sql\n297\t-- claude-tap-plus 后端数据库建表脚本\n298\t-- 数据库类型：SQLite\n299\t\n300\t-- ========== 会话管理域 ==========\n301\t\n302\t-- 1. 机器表\n303\tCREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS machines (\n304\t    id              INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT,\n305\t    machine_id      TEXT NOT NULL UNIQUE,\n306\t    os              TEXT NOT NULL,\n307\t    hostname        TEXT NOT NULL,\n308\t    username        TEXT NOT NULL,\n309\t    first_seen_at   DATETIME NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,\n310\t    last_seen_at    DATETIME\n311\t);\n312\t\n313\tCREATE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS idx_machines_hostname ON machines(hostname);\n314\t\n315\t-- 2. 项目表\n316\tCREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS projects (\n317\t    id              INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT,\n318\t    project_slug    TEXT NOT NULL UNIQUE,\n319\t    project_cwd     TEXT NOT NULL,\n320\t    first_seen_at   DATETIME NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,\n321\t    last_seen_at    DATETIME\n322\t);\n323\t\n324\tCREATE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS idx_projects_slug ON projects(project_slug);\n325\t\n326\t-- 3. 会话表\n327\tCREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS sessions (\n328\t    id              INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT,\n329\t    session_id      TEXT NOT NULL UNIQUE,\n330\t    machine_id      TEXT NOT NULL,\n331\t    os              TEXT NOT NULL,\n332\t    project_slug    TEXT NOT NULL,\n333\t    project_cwd     TEXT NOT NULL,\n334\t    trace_path      TEXT NOT NULL,\n335\t    model           TEXT,\n336\t    source          TEXT,\n337\t    status          TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'active',\n338\t    registered_at   DATETIME NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,\n339\t    closed_at       DATETIME,\n340\t    close_reason    TEXT\n341\t);\n342\t\n343\tCREATE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS idx_sessions_machine ON sessions(machine_id);\n344\tCREATE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS idx_sessions_project ON sessions(project_slug);\n345\tCREATE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS idx_sessions_status ON sessions(status);\n346\tCREATE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS idx_sessions_registered ON sessions(registered_at);\n347\t\n348\t-- ========== Issue 管理域 ==========\n349\t\n350\t-- 4. Issue 领取表\n351\tCREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS issue_claims (\n352\t    id              INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT,\n353\t    repo_full_name  TEXT NOT NULL,\n354\t    issue_number    INTEGER NOT NULL,\n355\t    issue_title     TEXT,\n356\t    status          TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'idle',\n357\t    session_id      TEXT,\n358\t    claimed_at      DATETIME,\n359\t    updated_at      DATETIME NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,\n360\t\n361\t    UNIQUE(repo_full_name, issue_number)\n362\t);\n363\t\n364\tCREATE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS idx_issue_claims_repo ON issue_claims(repo_full_name);\n365\tCREATE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS idx_issue_claims_session ON issue_claims(session_id);\n366\tCREATE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS idx_issue_claims_status ON issue_claims(status);\n367\t```\n368\t\n369\t---\n370\t\n371\t## 核心查询汇总\n372\t\n373\t### 会话管理查询\n374\t\n375\t```sql\n376\t-- 查询某机器的所有会话\n377\tSELECT session_id, project_slug, status, registered_at, closed_at\n378\tFROM sessions WHERE machine_id = 'Administrator@DESKTOP-ABC123'\n379\tORDER BY registered_at DESC;\n380\t\n381\t-- 查询某项目的所有会话\n382\tSELECT session_id, machine_id, status, registered_at, closed_at\n383\tFROM sessions WHERE project_slug = 'D--CodeDevelopment-CodeProject-claude-hk'\n384\tORDER BY registered_at DESC;\n385\t\n386\t-- 查询会话详情（含关联 machine 和 project 信息）\n387\tSELECT s.*, m.hostname, m.os, m.username, p.project_cwd\n388\tFROM sessions s\n389\tJOIN machines m ON s.machine_id = m.machine_id\n390\tJOIN projects p ON s.project_slug = p.project_slug\n391\tWHERE s.session_id = 'bf15cac4-7235-48ce-8853-5d4598547f31';\n392\t\n393\t-- 统计某项目的会话数\n394\tSELECT\n395\t    COUNT(*) as session_count,\n396\t    COUNT(CASE WHEN status = 'active' THEN 1 END) as active_count,\n397\t    COUNT(CASE WHEN status = 'closed' THEN 1 END) as closed_count\n398\tFROM sessions WHERE project_slug = 'D--CodeDevelopment-CodeProject-claude-hk';\n399\t\n400\t-- 会话列表（支持过滤，对应 GET /api/sessions）\n401\tSELECT session_id, machine_id, project_slug, status, registered_at, closed_at\n402\tFROM sessions\n403\tWHERE (? IS NULL OR machine_id = ?)\n404\t  AND (? IS NULL OR project_slug = ?)\n405\t  AND (? IS NULL OR status = ?)\n406\tORDER BY registered_at DESC;\n407\t\n408\t-- 列出所有机器及其项目\n409\tSELECT m.machine_id, m.os, m.hostname,\n410\t    COUNT(DISTINCT s.project_slug) as project_count,\n411\t    COUNT(s.session_id) as total_sessions\n412\tFROM machines m\n413\tLEFT JOIN sessions s ON m.machine_id = s.machine_id\n414\tGROUP BY m.machine_id;\n415\t\n416\t-- 超时清理：将超过 24 小时仍为 active 的会话标记为 closed\n417\tUPDATE sessions\n418\tSET status = 'closed', closed_at = datetime('now'), close_reason = 'timeout_cleanup'\n419\tWHERE status = 'active' AND registered_at < datetime('now', '-24 hours');\n420\t```\n421\t\n422\t### Issue 管理查询\n423\t\n424\t```sql\n425\t-- 查询某仓库所有 issue 状态\n426\tSELECT issue_number, issue_title, status, session_id, claimed_at\n427\tFROM issue_claims WHERE repo_full_name = 'xiaoheiDTF/claude-hk'\n428\tORDER BY issue_number;\n429\t\n430\t-- 查询某 session 领取的所有 issue\n431\tSELECT issue_number, repo_full_name, status, claimed_at\n432\tFROM issue_claims\n433\tWHERE session_id = 'bf15cac4-7235-48ce-8853-5d4598547f31'\n434\t  AND status != 'idle';\n435\t\n436\t-- 批量查询指定 issue 状态（/api/issue/check 用）\n437\tSELECT issue_number, status, session_id, claimed_at\n438\tFROM issue_claims\n439\tWHERE repo_full_name = 'xiaoheiDTF/claude-hk'\n440\t  AND issue_number IN (9, 10, 11, 12);\n441\t\n442\t-- 原子领取（/api/issue/claim 用）\n443\tSELECT status, session_id FROM issue_claims\n444\tWHERE repo_full_name = 'xiaoheiDTF/claude-hk' AND issue_number = 10;\n445\t-- 如果是 idle，则：\n446\tUPDATE issue_claims\n447\tSET status = 'claimed', session_id = 'session_xxx', claimed_at = CURRENT_TIMESTAMP\n448\tWHERE repo_full_name = 'xiaoheiDTF/claude-hk' AND issue_number = 10 AND status = 'idle';\n449\t\n450\t-- 释放某 session 的所有 issue（/api/issue/release-session 用）\n451\tUPDATE issue_claims\n452\tSET status = 'idle', session_id = NULL, claimed_at = NULL\n453\tWHERE session_id = 'bf15cac4-7235-48ce-8853-5d4598547f31'\n454\t  AND status NOT IN ('merged');\n455\t\n456\t-- 统计某仓库各状态 issue 数量\n457\tSELECT status, COUNT(*) as count\n458\tFROM issue_claims WHERE repo_full_name = 'xiaoheiDTF/claude-hk'\n459\tGROUP BY status;\n460\t```\n461\t\n462\t---\n463\t\n464\t## 索引汇总\n465\t\n466\t共 9 个索引：\n467\t\n468\t| 表 | 索引名 | 字段 | 用途 |\n469\t|----|--------|------|------|\n470\t| machines | `idx_machines_hostname` | hostname | 按主机名查询 |\n471\t| projects | `idx_projects_slug` | project_slug | 项目查找（已由 UNIQUE 隐含） |\n472\t| sessions | `idx_sessions_machine` | machine_id | 按机器查询会话 |\n473\t| sessions | `idx_sessions_project` | project_slug | 按项目查询会话 |\n474\t| sessions | `idx_sessions_status` | status | 按状态过滤 |\n475\t| sessions | `idx_sessions_registered` | registered_at | 按时间排序 |\n476\t| issue_claims | `idx_issue_claims_repo` | repo_full_name | 按仓库查询 issue |\n477\t| issue_claims | `idx_issue_claims_session` | session_id | 按 session 查询领取的 issue |\n478\t| issue_claims | `idx_issue_claims_status` | status | 按状态过滤 |\n479\t"}]}
